# Unified Sales, Marketing & CRM Portal Architecture

> **Version:** 1.0
> **Portal:** Sales, Marketing & Customer Relationship Management (CRM)
> **Architecture Style:** Unified Hotel ERP Portal

---

# 1. Overview

The **Sales, Marketing & CRM Portal** is responsible for acquiring, retaining, and growing guest and corporate business. It manages the complete customer lifecycle—from lead generation and sales opportunities to contracts, campaigns, loyalty, guest engagement, and post-stay relationships.

The portal integrates with the Front Office (PMS), Revenue Management, Food & Beverage, Events & Banquets, Finance, and Communication services while maintaining ownership of all sales, marketing, and CRM operations.

